<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Pemex details Q1 hydrocarbon trade.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Pemex details Q1 hydrocarbon trade.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) reported its exports and imports of crude oil, petroleum products, natural gas and chemicals for the first three months of the year. Figures in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>    Item		  Q1 1996	     Q1 1997</p>
<p>    Balance		 2,129		 2,349</p>
<p>	Exports	     2,459		 2,912</p>
<p>	Imports		 330		   562</p>
<p>    Crude Exports	 2,292		 2,679</p>
<p>    Petroleum Products   -267		  -478</p>
<p>	Exports		  48		    60</p>
<p>	Imports		 315		   539</p>
<p>    Natural Gas		 0		     1</p>
<p>	Exports		   8		    16</p>
<p>	Imports		   7		    15</p>
<p>    Petrochemicals	  104		   147</p>
<p>	Exports		 111		   156</p>
<p>	Imports		   8		     9</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903))</p>
